      "content": "i don't know if i can just \"exist\" in this space for much longer. it’s not just quiet, it’s heavy. it feels like i’m waiting for something that’s never coming back. like i'm just a leftover part of a story that already ended. what's even the point of keeping up the act when the person who made it all worth it is gone?",
